{"seq":3,"slug":"install-and-memory-init","title":"Hermes 安装与 memory 初始化","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/personal-agents-snapshot/hermes/install-and-memory-init","wordCount":1035,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"hermes-安装与-memory-初始化\">Hermes 安装与 memory 初始化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Hermes 的上手路径分三步：先把 CLI binary 装好（直接下载 / Homebrew 二选一）、再用 <code>hermes init</code> 初始化 memory 存储与配置目录、最后等第一次 curator cron 跑一遍把&quot;骨架库&quot;长出来。本节按这条线性流程走，目标是让读者在 20 分钟内拿到一个能被 coding agent 通过反向 MCP 调用的 Hermes 实例。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  start[开始] --&gt; install[安装&lt;br/&gt;brew 或 binary]&#10;  install --&gt; init[hermes init]&#10;  init --&gt; path[配置 storage path]&#10;  path --&gt; import[可选: import old context]&#10;  import --&gt; serve[hermes mcp-serve]&#10;  serve --&gt; wait[等首次 curator]&#10;  wait --&gt; ok[就绪]\">flowchart LR\n  start[开始] --&gt; install[安装&lt;br/&gt;brew 或 binary]\n  install --&gt; init[hermes init]\n  init --&gt; path[配置 storage path]\n  path --&gt; import[可选: import old context]\n  import --&gt; serve[hermes mcp-serve]\n  serve --&gt; wait[等首次 curator]\n  wait --&gt; ok[就绪]</pre><p>整套流程的核心是&quot;先把骨架长出来&quot;——init 完毕只是壳，真正能用的 memory 库需要至少一次 curator 周期把 importance / dedupe / retire 三件事跑完。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安装路径\">安装路径</h2><p>Hermes 官方提供两种安装路径。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>安装方式</th>\n<th>适合场景</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>直接下载 binary</td>\n<td>不想引入 brew 的 Linux server</td>\n<td>零依赖 / 离线友好</td>\n<td>升级要重新下载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Homebrew <code>brew install hermes-agent</code></td>\n<td>macOS 桌面开发者</td>\n<td>与系统包管理一致 / 一键升级</td>\n<td>仅 macOS / Linuxbrew</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两种方式装出来的二进制行为完全一致；选择只是部署偏好差异。</p>\n<h3 id=\"homebrew-安装步骤\">Homebrew 安装步骤</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"brew tap hermes-agent/tap&#10;brew install hermes-agent&#10;hermes --version\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> tap</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hermes-agent/tap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hermes-agent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hermes</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --version</span></span></code></pre></div><p>后续升级：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"brew upgrade hermes-agent\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upgrade</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hermes-agent</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"直接下载-binary-步骤\">直接下载 binary 步骤</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 假设是 macOS arm64&#10;curl -L -o hermes \\&#10;  https://example.invalid/hermes/releases/latest/hermes-darwin-arm64&#10;chmod +x hermes&#10;sudo mv hermes /usr/local/bin/hermes&#10;hermes --version\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 假设是 macOS arm64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -L</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hermes</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  https://example.invalid/hermes/releases/latest/hermes-darwin-arm64</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">chmod</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> +x</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hermes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sudo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mv</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> hermes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /usr/local/bin/hermes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hermes</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --version</span></span></code></pre></div><p>下载源 / 校验签名 / 版本号在实际官方发布时按官方说明执行；上面是结构示例。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hermes-init-初始化存储与配置\">hermes init：初始化存储与配置</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"hermes init\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hermes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> init</span></span></code></pre></div><p>init 会依次问几件事：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>storage path</strong>：默认 <code>~/.learnwy/hermes/</code>，可改；这是 memory SQLite + skill 目录 + audit log 的家。</li>\n<li><strong>default editor</strong>：用于后续 <code>hermes skill new</code> / <code>hermes memory edit</code> 时调起的编辑器（默认读 <code>$EDITOR</code>）。</li>\n<li><strong>enable curator cron</strong>：默认 yes，会在系统 cron / launchd 里登记一个每日 03:00 跑的 job。</li>\n<li><strong>import existing context</strong>：可选，把已有的笔记 / chat history 导入为初始 memory（详见下节）。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>完成后会生成的目录结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"~/.learnwy/hermes/&#10;  config.toml              # 顶层配置&#10;  memory.sqlite            # 主存储（FTS5 索引）&#10;  skills/                  # 自创 skill 根目录&#10;    claude-code/           # 官方 bundled skill&#10;      SKILL.md&#10;  audit/                   # NDJSON 审计日志按天分片&#10;    2026-05-14.ndjson\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>~/.learnwy/hermes/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  config.toml              # 顶层配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  memory.sqlite            # 主存储（FTS5 索引）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  skills/                  # 自创 skill 根目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    claude-code/           # 官方 bundled skill</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      SKILL.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  audit/                   # NDJSON 审计日志按天分片</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    2026-05-14.ndjson</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>config.toml</code> 大致这样：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"[storage]&#10;path = &quot;/Users/&lt;you&gt;/.learnwy/hermes&quot;&#10;&#10;[curator]&#10;schedule = &quot;0 3 * * *&quot;&#10;importance_threshold = 0.3&#10;stale_days = 90&#10;&#10;[mcp]&#10;listen_address = &quot;127.0.0.1:7654&quot;&#10;require_token = true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[storage]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>path = \"/Users/&#x3C;you>/.learnwy/hermes\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[curator]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>schedule = \"0 3 * * *\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>importance_threshold = 0.3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stale_days = 90</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[mcp]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>listen_address = \"127.0.0.1:7654\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>require_token = true</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"可选-import-existing-context\">可选：import existing context</h2><p>如果你之前用过别的笔记 / chat 工具，可以一次性导入作为 Hermes 的初始 memory：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 从纯文本笔记导入&#10;hermes import notes --path ~/notes/ --recurse --tag personal&#10;&#10;# 从 chat platform 导出文件导入（飞书 / Slack 的导出 JSON）&#10;hermes import chat --format slack --file ./team-export.json --tag team&#10;&#10;# 从 Claude Code transcript 导入&#10;hermes import transcript --path ~/.claude/projects/ --since 2026-01-01\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 从纯文本笔记导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hermes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> notes</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --path</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/notes/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --recurse</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --tag</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> personal</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 从 chat platform 导出文件导入（飞书 / Slack 的导出 JSON）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hermes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> chat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> slack</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --file</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ./team-export.json</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --tag</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> team</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 从 Claude Code transcript 导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hermes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> transcript</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --path</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ~/.claude/projects/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --since</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 2026-01-01</span></span></code></pre></div><p>import 完成后每条变成一个 memory entry，自动打上初始 importance score（按字数、重复度、显式标记的优先级）；具体 score 算法在 <a href=\"curator-and-skill-self-improvement\"><code>6_curator-and-skill-self-improvement.md</code></a> 详述。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>import 源</th>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>默认 importance</th>\n<th>适合场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纯文本笔记</td>\n<td><code>hermes import notes</code></td>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>Markdown / Obsidian / Logseq</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Slack 导出</td>\n<td><code>hermes import chat --format slack</code></td>\n<td>0.4</td>\n<td>团队历史归档</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>飞书导出</td>\n<td><code>hermes import chat --format feishu</code></td>\n<td>0.4</td>\n<td>飞书群历史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claude transcript</td>\n<td><code>hermes import transcript</code></td>\n<td>0.6</td>\n<td>之前用 Claude Code 的项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Markdown wiki</td>\n<td><code>hermes import wiki</code></td>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>个人 wiki 一次性合并</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>import 不是一定要做——空仓库起步也合理，按需 write 即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第一次-curator-周期\">第一次 curator 周期</h2><p>curator 是 Hermes 的&quot;看门人&quot;。init 后第一次 cron 触发可能要等到次日 03:00；如果你想立刻跑一遍，手动触发：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"hermes curator run --dry-run        # 看会做什么&#10;hermes curator run                  # 实际跑\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hermes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> curator</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --dry-run</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 看会做什么</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hermes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> curator</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  # 实际跑</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第一次 curator 周期会做四件事：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>importance re-rank</strong>：把当前所有 memory entry 重排，按 (importance × recency-decay) 算综合分。</li>\n<li><strong>dedupe</strong>：检测内容近似的条目（FTS5 hash + 编辑距离），保留最高分，其它标为 <code>superseded</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>retire stale</strong>：超过 <code>stale_days</code>（默认 90 天）且 access count = 0 的条目标为 <code>retired</code>，不再返回给查询。</li>\n<li><strong>emit metrics</strong>：把本次 curator 处理量 / 改变数写入 <code>audit/curator-&lt;date&gt;.ndjson</code>，便于事后追溯。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>dry-run 输出大致：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"curator-dry-run:&#10;  total-entries: 1247&#10;  to-rerank: 89  (importance score moved by &gt;0.1)&#10;  to-dedupe: 12  (would mark 7 as superseded)&#10;  to-retire: 34  (90+ days no access)&#10;  estimated-time: 4.2s\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>curator-dry-run:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  total-entries: 1247</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  to-rerank: 89  (importance score moved by >0.1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  to-dedupe: 12  (would mark 7 as superseded)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  to-retire: 34  (90+ days no access)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  estimated-time: 4.2s</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"hermes-status-健康检查\">hermes status：健康检查</h2><p>curator 跑完后跑一次 status：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"hermes status\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hermes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> status</span></span></code></pre></div><p>输出大致：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"hermes:&#10;  storage: ~/.learnwy/hermes (free=120GB)&#10;  memory-entries: 1247 (active=1206, retired=34, superseded=7)&#10;  skills: 1 (claude-code bundled)&#10;  curator:&#10;    last-run: 2026-05-14 03:00:00 UTC&#10;    next-run: 2026-05-15 03:00:00 UTC&#10;    metrics: 89/12/34 (rerank/dedupe/retire)&#10;  mcp-serve: not-listening (run `hermes mcp-serve` to start)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>hermes:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  storage: ~/.learnwy/hermes (free=120GB)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  memory-entries: 1247 (active=1206, retired=34, superseded=7)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  skills: 1 (claude-code bundled)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  curator:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    last-run: 2026-05-14 03:00:00 UTC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    next-run: 2026-05-15 03:00:00 UTC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    metrics: 89/12/34 (rerank/dedupe/retire)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  mcp-serve: not-listening (run `hermes mcp-serve` to start)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>最后一行提醒：要让 coding agent 调用 Hermes 必须先 <code>hermes mcp-serve</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"hermes mcp-serve &amp;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hermes</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mcp-serve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>启动后在 Claude Code 的 MCP 配置里加：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;hermes&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;hermes&quot;,&#10;      &quot;args&quot;: [&quot;mcp-stdio&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mcpServers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"hermes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"command\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hermes\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"args\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mcp-stdio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>下次 coding agent 起 session 就能看到 <code>memory.query</code> / <code>memory.write</code> / <code>skill.list</code> / <code>skill.dispatch</code> 等 tool 可用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"陷阱与常见问题\">陷阱与常见问题</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>storage path 选了云盘同步目录</strong>：iCloud / Dropbox 会同步 SQLite 中间状态，导致 corruption；务必放本地非同步目录。</li>\n<li><strong>跳过首次 curator</strong>：未 curator 过的 memory 全是 raw 状态，查询返回 noise 多；至少 dry-run + 实际跑一次。</li>\n<li><strong>直接编辑 memory.sqlite</strong>：FTS5 索引必须用 <code>hermes memory edit</code> 维护，手改 SQLite 会破坏倒排索引。</li>\n<li><strong>多机器共用同一 storage</strong>：SQLite WAL 模式不支持多 host 并发；多设备同步要用专门的 sync 协议（见 <a href=\"seven-terminal-backends\"><code>5_seven-terminal-backends.md</code></a> 末尾的 mesh 模式）。</li>\n<li><strong>忘记 <code>hermes mcp-serve</code></strong>：coding agent 没看到 Hermes tool 时第一件事就是 status 看 <code>mcp-serve</code> 行。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>两种安装：直接下载 binary（Linux 友好）/ Homebrew（macOS 友好）。</li>\n<li>首次 init 配置 storage path + curator cron + 可选 import 旧 context。</li>\n<li>第一次 curator 周期做四件事：importance re-rank / dedupe / retire stale / emit metrics。</li>\n<li><code>hermes status</code> 是健康检查入口，逐行确认 storage / memory / skill / curator / mcp。</li>\n<li>最后 <code>hermes mcp-serve</code> 启动反向 MCP server，coding agent 才能调用。</li>\n<li>下一篇 <a href=\"first-skill-and-claude-code-bundle\"><code>4_first-skill-and-claude-code-bundle.md</code></a> 自创第一个 skill 并启用 bundled <code>claude-code</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Hermes 安装与 memory 初始化","id":"hermes-安装与-memory-初始化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"安装路径","id":"安装路径"},{"level":3,"text":"Homebrew 安装步骤","id":"homebrew-安装步骤"},{"level":3,"text":"直接下载 binary 步骤","id":"直接下载-binary-步骤"},{"level":2,"text":"hermes init：初始化存储与配置","id":"hermes-init-初始化存储与配置"},{"level":2,"text":"可选：import existing context","id":"可选-import-existing-context"},{"level":2,"text":"第一次 curator 周期","id":"第一次-curator-周期"},{"level":2,"text":"hermes status：健康检查","id":"hermes-status-健康检查"},{"level":2,"text":"陷阱与常见问题","id":"陷阱与常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Hermes 使用场景与横向对比","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/personal-agents-snapshot/hermes/use-cases-and-comparison"},"next":{"title":"Hermes 第一个 skill 与 claude-code bundle","url":"/l-doc-books/c/ai-books/personal-agents/personal-agents-snapshot/hermes/first-skill-and-claude-code-bundle"}}